                "tab_1_page": "",
                "tab_1_page_order": "3",
                "tab_1_richtext": "<p>Boost your skincare routine with Booster Pro, designed to enhance absorption and illuminate your natural radiance. A curated selection of products that customers consistently rate and recommend. Tried, tested, and widely loved.</p>",
