                "tab_2_page_order": "3",
                "tab_2_richtext": "<p><strong>Boost your skincare routine with Booster Pro, designed to enhance absorption and illuminate your natural radiance.</strong></p><p>This innovative device improves skin definition and pore care while letting you customize your LED color for a personalized glow.</p>",
